      "content": "i know you're trying to be kind but it doesn't change the math of it. i'm just a constant drain on their time, money, and energy. the more i try to \"make my life a priority,\" the more it costs them. sometimes i can't help but think that the most loving thing i could actually do for them... the only way to truly stop being a weight... is to just not be here anymore. it feels almost like the only selfless choice left.",
